290
00:15:21,639 --> 00:15:22,360
Gu Jiachen.

291
00:15:55,559 --> 00:15:56,200
Gu Jiachen,

292
00:15:57,039 --> 00:15:58,279
I don't care what you're up to,

293
00:15:58,600 --> 00:15:59,720
